@startuml 投影矩阵和视锥体
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam componentBackgroundColor #FFF9C4
skinparam componentBorderColor #F57F17
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #E8F5E9
skinparam noteBorderColor #2E7D32
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei

title 投影矩阵和视锥体

component "视锥体参数" as Frustum {
    [FOV-Y: PI/3] as FOVY
    [Aspect: Width/Height] as Aspect
    [Near-Z: 0.5f] as NearZ
    [Far-Z: 1000.0f] as FarZ
}

note top of Frustum
    SetFrustum(fovY, aspect, nearZ, farZ)
    定义可视空间
end note

component "投影矩阵" as ProjMatrix {
    label "透视投影矩阵\nProj = PerspectiveFovLH(fovY, aspect, nearZ, farZ)"
}

FOVY --> ProjMatrix
Aspect --> ProjMatrix
NearZ --> ProjMatrix
FarZ --> ProjMatrix

note right of ProjMatrix
    投影矩阵公式:
    
    yscale = cot(fovY/2)
    xscale = yscale / aspect
    
    [xscale    0         0              0      ]
    [0      yscale       0              0      ]
    [0         0    farZ/(farZ-nearZ)   1      ]
    [0         0   -nearZ*farZ/(farZ-nearZ) 0 ]
    
    将视锥体映射到NDC空间[-1,1]³
end note

component "视口变换" as Viewport {
    [TopLeftX: 0] as X
    [TopLeftY: 0] as Y
    [Width: ClientWidth] as W
    [Height: ClientHeight] as H
    [MinDepth: 0.0f] as MinD
    [MaxDepth: 1.0f] as MaxD
}

note top of Viewport
    SetViewPort(x, y, w, h, minD, maxD)
    NDC到屏幕空间的映射
end note

ProjMatrix --> Viewport : NDC空间

note bottom of Viewport
    视口变换:
    screenX = (ndcX + 1) * width / 2 + topLeftX
    screenY = (1 - ndcY) * height / 2 + topLeftY
    depth = ndcZ * (maxD - minD) + minD
end note

component "完整变换管线" as Pipeline {
    label "模型空间 → 世界空间 → 视图空间 → 裁剪空间 → NDC → 屏幕空间"
}

Viewport --> Pipeline

@enduml
